feat(subscriptions): admin-only /admin/suscripciones preview + reset action (still inactive behind PAYMENTS_ENABLED)

- New server-guarded route /admin/suscripciones (requireAdmin → non-admins
  redirected to admin login; unreachable by URL for regular users). Renders the
  REAL pro-facing SubscriptionPanel in preview, with a banner showing flag state +
  plans, so admin can see the customer page before launch. Added a "Suscripciones"
  tab to the admin nav.
- Self-API /api/payments/subscription GET now treats an ADMIN caller as enabled
  (preview) while PAYMENTS_ENABLED is off; non-admins still get { enabled:false }
  with no data. Card checkout POST stays 404 while off for everyone (no real
  checkout; gateway is still a stub).
- Admin "Eliminar / reset" action: deleteSubscription() removes the subscription
  row + its payment ledger so preview/testing leaves no rows on real pros
  (/api/admin/subscriptions action:"reset" + button in the admin card).

Flag OFF (default) unchanged for everyone: pros keep full free access, regular
users see zero subscription/payment UI; the admin preview + the admin user-profile
card are the only visible surfaces. No card data stored.

